    "summary": "Bivariate rough vol did NOT break the HAR-ABS ceiling. Best model: HAR-ABS. All 3 assets confirmed extremely rough (H=0.007 SPY, 0.001 GLD, 0.003 TW0050). Cross-asset vol (GLD) and H are significant IS predictors (F=24.0, F=49.2) but OOS advantage vanishes (DM=+2.354 favors HAR-ABS). Classic IS overfitting: more parameters hurt OOS. HAR-Rough univariate is closest to HAR-ABS (DM=1.345, NS) but still does not beat it."
